OL,3,GNEWSANew bus routes to airport backed
OL,4,Aby bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlane passengers and staff could
OL,7,F"greatly benefit" from new bus routes
OL,8,Fbeing created, London Southend Airport
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FNew bus services have been suggested to
OL,12,Flink the Essex terminal with the city's
OL,13,Ftravel centre in York Road, as well as
OL,14,FChalkwell, Thorpe Bay and Shoebury.
OL,16,FThey are some of the measures set out
OL,17,Fin Southend-on-Sea City Council's
OL,18,Fproposed transport strategy.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
