OL,3,GNEWSANew bus routes to airport backed
OL,4,Aby bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition councillors are sceptical of
OL,7,Fthe plans, but an airport spokesperson
OL,8,Fsaid new bus routes would strengthen
OL,9,Fits "sustainable onward transport
OL,10,Foptions".
